The ad-making guidance that comes with this plugin (the playbook takepilot's server returns from
get_playbook, which the skill in skills/takepilot-ad reads) includes ideas adapted from the following
MIT-licensed projects.
The guidance is rewritten in our own words for Japanese short vertical video ads; no text was copied
verbatim. The sections drawn on are: variations, results, scripts and pacing.

